# Gate integrity (Prism P1 ac6c31b59f61, t_8c9a779a). On pull_request and merge_group GitHub reads the
# workflow YAML from the PR/candidate commit, so a PR can rewrite a required job itself; checking gate
# scripts out of the base ref (ci.yaml detect + all-checks-pass) cannot stop that. These paths decide
# whether a PR passes, so a change to them needs an owner's review.
# INERT until the main ruleset turns on "Require review from Code Owners" (admin; not set as of 2026-10-10).
/.github/                       @Kyzcreig
/scripts/ci/                    @Kyzcreig
/scripts/run_tests.sh           @Kyzcreig
/scripts/run_tests_parallel.py  @Kyzcreig
/.gitleaks.toml                 @Kyzcreig
